# #5840 S4, a5e2e2ef's R6: discarding a claim never swallows a real #5841 detection.
MODULE: StaleDetectionHonouredDiscardedClaimSwallowsStaleProbe
TARGET: StaleDetectionHonoured
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claim the relinquish discards drops its probe's stale finding instead of marking the activation stale (R6)
PERTURBS: LiveClaimDone
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithRestart = FALSE

--- FIND
        /\ CASE stale -> /\ lProbeFailed' = TRUE
                         /\ lDead' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the discarded claim swallows the stale probe.
        /\ CASE stale -> /\ lProbeFailed' = TRUE
                         /\ lDead' = lDead
--- END
